{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144932,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table XII. Optimization Effect: BO-Selected Minus Fixed-Recipe SwinFusion++\nNote. Optimization effect: BO-selected minus fixed-recipe SwinFusion++. X → X = within-dataset. C23/C40 = FaceForensics++ DeepFakes at compression C23/C40; CDF = Celeb-DF v2; DFo = DeeperForensics-1.0. Intervals: 95% percentile intervals from 5,000 stratified cluster-bootstrap draws, not adjusted for multiplicity. Raw p: two-sided rank-based cluster permutation test (5,000 permutations); Holm p: Holm-adjusted within the family; “< 0.005” = Holm-adjusted p below 0.005, including the smallest attainable values. Families: within (m = 4) and transfer (m = 9). CDF → CDF is grouping-dependent: Holm p = 0.077 when pooled with the 8 architecture tests."}},
